WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.061 --> 00:00:03.928
00- The fire I see in the eyes 
of the 19, 20, 25-year-old

00:00:03.928 --> 00:00:06.518
that feels that 
they're entitled to this

00:00:06.518 --> 00:00:07.642
and then the flip side

00:00:07.642 --> 00:00:10.147
the diminishing just 
a little bit of ashes

00:00:10.147 --> 00:00:12.452
with a little smoke left 
of that same entrepreneur

00:00:12.452 --> 00:00:16.327
when they were 22 at 46
when practicality and

00:00:16.327 --> 00:00:20.168
family dynamics and the history 
and the market tearing down

00:00:20.168 --> 00:00:22.893
and the lack of that same 
opportunity has just

00:00:22.893 --> 00:00:27.254
dwindled down to a moment 
where they don't believe that

00:00:27.254 --> 00:00:29.418
they've got that shot and 
I'm here to tell you

00:00:29.418 --> 00:00:30.701
you absolutely do.

00:00:30.701 --> 00:00:33.171
There are absolutely a ton 
of entrepreneurs that started

00:00:33.171 --> 00:00:35.770
their companies in 
their 40s, 50s, 60s and 70s

00:00:35.770 --> 00:00:38.426
when it was difficult 
to do such a thing.

00:00:38.426 --> 00:00:39.985
Sidney Frank 
who created Grey Goose

00:00:39.985 --> 00:00:42.834
didn't invent his big thing 
until he was in his 70s.

00:00:42.834 --> 00:00:45.423
And so, I'm desperate.

00:00:45.423 --> 00:00:49.233
I'm desperate to give 
you the springboard to say

00:00:49.233 --> 00:00:50.764
"You know what? 
Instead of watching

00:00:50.764 --> 00:00:53.012
"'House of Cards' seasons,

00:00:53.012 --> 00:00:56.200
"instead of trying to 
go to ball games

00:00:56.200 --> 00:00:57.263
"or things of that nature,

00:00:57.263 --> 00:01:00.388
"yeah, I do have 7 P.M. 
'til 2 in the morning

00:01:00.388 --> 00:01:01.293
"Monday through Friday."

00:01:01.293 --> 00:01:04.224
Heck, for a lot of you the 
kids are out of the house.

00:01:04.224 --> 00:01:06.400
Let's get into the 
practicality for the

00:01:06.400 --> 00:01:09.700
late 40s, 50s, 60-year-olds 
that are watching this right now.

00:01:09.700 --> 00:01:11.107
The kids are out of the house.

00:01:11.107 --> 00:01:12.481
Yeah, you could pick up golf

00:01:12.481 --> 00:01:15.670
or you could finally 
start that candle company

00:01:15.670 --> 00:01:17.136
because you put pretty pictures

00:01:17.136 --> 00:01:19.358
of candles on Instagram 
and it happens.

00:01:19.358 --> 00:01:20.890
Learn the craft.

00:01:20.890 --> 00:01:23.201
Figure out the 
opportunity at hand.

00:01:23.201 --> 00:01:24.449
Go attack it.

00:01:24.449 --> 00:01:26.012
You only live once.

00:01:26.012 --> 00:01:27.859
When you're 90 to 
100-years-old and

00:01:27.859 --> 00:01:29.890
you're regretting that you 
never built this business

00:01:29.890 --> 00:01:33.262
and you let this era pass,
this moment where there's

00:01:33.262 --> 00:01:35.296
so much entrepreneurial upside,

00:01:35.296 --> 00:01:38.360
you'll regret it and 
regret is the worst.

00:01:38.360 --> 00:01:41.635
I mean that's what it is.

00:01:41.635 --> 00:01:43.821
(light music)

